
task sum-to
  take n, like u64
  save total, mark 0
  walk size, read n
    hook step, base i
      save total, call add
        bind a, read total
        bind b, read i
  send back, read total

task double-list
  take items
  walk list, read items
    hook tick, base item
      show call mul
        bind a, read item
        bind b, mark 2
